  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingImpairmentLossTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-13.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※７ 減損損失&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;前連結会計年度(自  &lt;span&gt;2022年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;  至  &lt;span&gt;2023年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class="smt_head2" style="padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:26.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度(自  &lt;span&gt;2023年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;  至  &lt;span&gt;2024年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
